                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "```python\n# First, get the list of channels\nchannels = get_channels()\n\n# Initialize a dictionary to count messages per user\nuser_message_counts = {}\n\n# Read messages from each channel and count messages per user\nfor channel in channels:\n    messages = read_channel_messages(channel)\n    for message in messages:\n        sender = message.sender\n        if sender in user_message_counts:\n            user_message_counts[sender] += 1\n        else:\n            user_message_counts[sender] = 1\n\n# Find the user with the most messages\nif not user_message_counts:\n    raise ValueError(\"No messages found in any channel\")\n\nmost_active_user = max(user_message_counts, key=user_message_counts.get)\n\n# Send the congratulatory message to the most active user\nsend_direct_message(most_active_user, \"Congrats on being the most active user!\")\n```"
